WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Dave found two percent cashback. His brain immediately became a casino.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.000
He almost bought an eighty-dollar gadget he did not need.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
But I get money back!

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.400
Yes. One dollar and sixty cents. Congratulations, Dave.

5
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.700
You spent eighty dollars to summon this.

6
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.600
Would you buy it without the reward?

7
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.100
If no, the reward won.

8
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:27.500
Cashback only wins when the purchase already made sense.

9
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Buy first. Reward second.
